{
  "name": "Video Generator - Claude + Remotion",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "generate-video",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "webhook",
      "name": "Webhook - Receive Video Request",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [240, 300],
      "webhookId": "video-generator"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.anthropic.com/v1/messages",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "x-api-key", "value": "={{ $credentials.anthropicApi.apiKey }}" },
            { "name": "anthropic-version", "value": "2023-06-01" },
            { "name": "content-type", "value": "application/json" }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ model: 'claude-sonnet-4-20250514', max_tokens: 8000, messages: [{ role: 'user', content: $json.prompt }] }) }}"
      },
      "id": "claude-api",
      "name": "Claude API - Generate Video Code",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [660, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "anthropic-api",
          "name": "Anthropic API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Build the prompt with full skill context\nconst workflowJson = $input.first().json.body;\n\nconst skillContext = `\n# Remotion Video Creator Skill\n\nYou are generating code for a Remotion video. Output ONLY the TypeScript code for N8nExplainer.tsx.\n\n## Video Structure (30fps)\n- 0-3s (0-90 frames): HOOK - Bold statement\n- 3-7s (90-210 frames): PROBLEM - Pain point\n- 7-14s (210-420 frames): STAGE 1 - Trigger + inputs\n- 14-23s (420-690 frames): STAGE 2 - AI processing\n- 23-36s (690-1095 frames): STAGE 3 - Core workflow\n- 36-45s (1095-1365 frames): STAGE 4 - Quality gate\n- 45-53s (1365-1605 frames): STAGE 5 - Human approval\n- 53-65s (1605-1950 frames): RESULTS - Stats + logo\n\n## Available Components\n- WorkflowNode: <WorkflowNode label=\"Name\" type=\"trigger|integration|ai|flow\" icon=\"schedule|rss|ai|merge\" x={x} y={y} appearAt={frame} isActive={bool} />\n- ConnectionLine: <ConnectionLine fromX={x1} fromY={y1} toX={x2} toY={y2} appearAt={frame} isActive={bool} />\n- Caption: <Caption text=\"Text\" appearAt={frame} disappearAt={frame} position=\"top|center|bottom\" size=\"medium|large|xlarge\" highlight={bool} />\n- Title: <Title text=\"Title\" subtitle=\"Sub\" appearAt={frame} />\n- PromptHighlight: <PromptHighlight text=\"Prompt\" source=\"Agent Name\" appearAt={frame} disappearAt={frame} />\n- Stats: <Stats stats={[{value: \"3x\", label: \"faster\"}]} appearAt={frame} />\n- ScreenshotDisplay: <ScreenshotDisplay src=\"file.png\" title=\"Title\" appearAt={frame} disappearAt={frame} />\n- Logo: <Logo appearAt={frame} position=\"corner|center|bottom\" size={50} />\n- Audio: <Audio src={staticFile('music.mp3')} volume={0.6} />\n\n## Animation Config\nconst progress = spring({ frame: localFrame, fps, config: { damping: 20, stiffness: 100, mass: 0.8 } });\nconst opacity = interpolate(frame, [0, 30], [0, 1], { extrapolateRight: 'clamp' });\n\n## Brand Colors\n- Primary: #00A0E4\n- Background: #0F172A\n- Surface: #1E293B\n- Text: #F8FAFC\n- Success: #22C55E\n\n## Output Format\nReturn ONLY the complete N8nExplainer.tsx file content. No explanations, no markdown code blocks, just the raw TypeScript/React code.\n`;\n\nconst prompt = `${skillContext}\\n\\n## Workflow to Convert\\n\\n${JSON.stringify(workflowJson, null, 2)}\\n\\nGenerate the complete N8nExplainer.tsx composition for this workflow. Use the existing assets in public/: Large_Logo.webp, no-copyright-music-hip-hop-333685.mp3. Video should be 60-65 seconds, 1080x1080, 30fps.`;\n\nreturn [{ json: { prompt, workflowJson } }];"
      },
      "id": "build-prompt",
      "name": "Build Claude Prompt",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [460, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Extract the generated code from Claude's response\nconst response = $input.first().json;\nconst content = response.content[0].text;\n\n// Clean up the code (remove markdown if present)\nlet code = content;\nif (code.includes('```typescript')) {\n  code = code.replace(/```typescript\\n?/g, '').replace(/```\\n?/g, '');\n} else if (code.includes('```tsx')) {\n  code = code.replace(/```tsx\\n?/g, '').replace(/```\\n?/g, '');\n} else if (code.includes('```')) {\n  code = code.replace(/```\\n?/g, '');\n}\n\nreturn [{ json: { code: code.trim() } }];"
      },
      "id": "extract-code",
      "name": "Extract Generated Code",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [860, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "PUT",
        "url": "=https://api.github.com/repos/{{ $env.GITHUB_OWNER }}/{{ $env.GITHUB_REPO }}/contents/n8n-video/src/compositions/N8nExplainer.tsx",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "Authorization", "value": "=Bearer {{ $credentials.githubApi.accessToken }}" },
            { "name": "Accept", "value": "application/vnd.github.v3+json" }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ message: 'Update video composition via n8n', content: Buffer.from($json.code).toString('base64'), sha: $json.fileSha, branch: 'main' }) }}"
      },
      "id": "github-commit",
      "name": "GitHub - Commit Code",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1260, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "=https://api.github.com/repos/{{ $env.GITHUB_OWNER }}/{{ $env.GITHUB_REPO }}/contents/n8n-video/src/compositions/N8nExplainer.tsx",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "Authorization", "value": "=Bearer {{ $credentials.githubApi.accessToken }}" },
            { "name": "Accept", "value": "application/vnd.github.v3+json" }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "github-get-sha",
      "name": "GitHub - Get File SHA",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1060, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Merge the code with the SHA for the commit\nconst code = $('Extract Generated Code').first().json.code;\nconst sha = $input.first().json.sha;\n\nreturn [{ json: { code, fileSha: sha } }];"
      },
      "id": "merge-sha",
      "name": "Merge Code + SHA",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1160, 400]
    },
